{"player":{"summary":"Kit crosses the commons to check on Teo, who is hovering silently by the galley counter watching the recycler readout.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"okafor","action":"Keeps her eyes on the weather relay, then assigns Kit the array tie-down and tells Teo she wants a straight answer on the recycler before the storm hits.","says":"Navarro, arrays are yours — I want the panels stowed and the Mule in the garage by 18:00. Teo, that rattle has been six days. I want numbers, not a look on your face.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Deflects from the recycler by fussing over the readout and offering a cheerful, vague explanation about normal wear, clearly hoping Kit changes the subject.","says":"Oh — it's fine, it's just, you know, the impeller's got a wobble, they all get a wobble, I'll pull the housing after breakfast and it'll be — it's probably nothing. Nothing-ish.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[{"text":"Priya Raman comes back over the intercom, sharper this time, saying the Mule's battery swap is still unsigned and she'll log it as a scheduling failure if nobody answers by mid-morning.","scope":"local","who":["raman"],"where":"garage","visibility":"heard","moves":[]}]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit authorizes and signs off on the Mule's battery swap paperwork, then heads to the rover garage to look the Mule over themselves.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":"garage"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"okafor","action":"Stays at the galley table and presses Teo for actual numbers on the recycler before she'll let him leave, refusing to accept another vague promise.","says":"Impeller wobble is a symptom, not a diagnosis. Flow rate, hours since onset, or I start shutting down non-essential draws myself.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Deflects Okafor with half-numbers pulled from memory, then escapes to hydroponics to pull the recycler housing before she can ask a follow-up question.","says":"Seventy percent, give or take — I'll have the housing off and real numbers by lunch, promise, absolutely by lunch.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":"hydro"}
 ],
 "events":[{"text":"In the lab, Dr. Lev Sorensen quietly shifts his unlogged incubator flasks into a cold drawer and wipes the condensation ring off the shelf before anyone wanders in.","scope":"local","who":["sorensen"],"where":"lab","visibility":"hidden","moves":[]}]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit spends the next stretch handing Priya tools and helping her seat the new cells in the Mule, then suits up and heads out to the solar field to start the array tie-down before the storm closes in.","needs_roll":true,"skill":"tech","difficulty":"normal","move_to":"surface"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"raman","action":"Priya finishes torquing the battery clamps, runs a load test on the new cells, and talks the whole time about the storm timeline and her daughter's birthday, needling Kit to get the array tied down before the wind picks up.","says":"Load's holding at ninety-four percent. Go on, get out there — and if you lose a panel to the wind I'm not flying out to fetch it. Six weeks and I'm on a lander, Kit. Six weeks.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Teo Bauer's voice comes over the intercom from hydroponics, too fast: the recycler housing bolts are seized and he's found scoring on the impeller shaft he can't explain.","scope":"local","who":["bauer"],"where":"hydro","visibility":"heard","moves":[]},
  {"text":"Dr. Imani Okafor announces over the station channel that all non-essential water draws are suspended until the recycler is back at full output, and asks for an ETA she can put in the log.","scope":"local","who":["okafor"],"where":"commons","visibility":"heard","moves":[]}
 ]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit leaves the garage and heads to Hydroponics to help Teo diagnose and repair the seized recycler housing and scored impeller shaft.","needs_roll":true,"skill":"tech","difficulty":"normal","move_to":"hydro"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"raman","action":"Priya finishes coiling her tool roll, decides she is not waiting on the recycler to get the solar array tied down, and heads for the suit room to prep an EVA.","says":"Fine. I'll suit up and start pinning the array myself. If the wind beats me out there, that's on the forecast, not on us.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":"suitroom"}
 ],
 "events":[{"text":"Okafor comes over the station channel asking Kit for a hard ETA on the recycler and noting the storm's arrival has been moved up in the latest relay.","scope":"local","who":["okafor"],"where":"hydro","visibility":"heard","moves":[]}]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit commits to pulling the scored impeller shaft now and machining it, accepting a few hours of recycler downtime to make sure it survives the storm.","needs_roll":true,"skill":"tech","difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Teo agrees immediately and starts clearing the housing and laying out the puller and shim stock, talking fast about how he can log the downtime and take the water rationing heat off Kit with Okafor.","says":"Yes. Pull it. I'll tell Okafor three hours — no, four, say four so nobody's surprised — and I'll do the rationing log, that's mine anyway. Just tell me what to hold and I'll hold it.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[{"text":"Raman's voice crackles on the channel from the airlock: the wind's already throwing grit and she's going out to the array regardless.","scope":"local","who":["raman"],"where":"suitroom","visibility":"heard","moves":[{"id":"raman","to":"surface"}]}]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit suits up and heads out to the solar field to help Priya Raman pin down the array before the storm front arrives.","needs_roll":true,"skill":"tech","difficulty":"hard","move_to":"surface"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Teo chucks the scored shaft into the lathe and starts cutting, then — alone in Hydroponics — takes extra dressing passes to grind the machined gouge away past what the repair needs, so the scoring can't be traced back to anything.","says":"Shaft's in the lathe. Say four hours, maybe less. Go — I've got the log and the rationing numbers, that's mine anyway.","reveals":null,"visible":false,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Okafor comes over the station channel and orders Raman to abandon the array tie-down and be back through the airlock before the front reaches the field.","scope":"local","who":["okafor","raman"],"where":"surface","visibility":"heard","moves":[]},
  {"text":"The storm front crosses the solar field early, and a rolling wall of grit buries the panels and drops array output while Raman is still out on the racks.","scope":"regional","who":["raman"],"where":"surface","visibility":"heard","moves":[],"effects":{"world":[{"key":"power","value":"solar output falling as dust front crosses the field"}],"groups":[],"clocks":[{"id":"storm","delta":2}],"new_clock":null}}
 ]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit asks Teo to hold the hydro console and heads down through the suitroom toward the rover garage to find out who is inside.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":"garage"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Teo plants himself at the console, hands hovering, and starts nervously narrating every reading on the board to himself while Kit is gone.","says":"Okay. Okay, I've got it — I'll watch it, I won't touch anything, I'll just watch. Kit — if the board throws anything I don't like, do I call you or Okafor? Because I don't think I should be the one deciding that.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Over the channel, Okafor reports flatly that Raman is through the inner door and out of her suit, dust everywhere and her visor cracked at the seal.","scope":"local","who":["okafor","raman"],"where":"suitroom","visibility":"heard","moves":[{"id":"raman","to":"suitroom"}]}
 ]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit tells Teo to help Priya and to raise Dr. Sorensen on the channel so he can prep for a possible injury.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Teo fumbles for the intercom, punches the lab channel and rattles off a too-fast page for Sorensen, then hovers half out of his seat, torn between the console he was told to watch and the suitroom he's been told to help with.","says":"Lev? Lev, it's Teo — Priya's in the lock, visor's cracked, Imani's with her. Kit says prep for an injury. I'm — Kit, do I leave the board? Because if I leave the board nobody's watching the board and the recycler's still down and I really don't want to be the guy who—","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Dr. Lev Sorensen answers the page from the lab, says he's coming, and leaves the incubator running behind him as he heads for the suitroom.","scope":"local","who":["sorensen"],"where":"lab","visibility":"heard","moves":[{"id":"sorensen","to":"suitroom"}]}
 ]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit tells Teo to stay on the hydroponics board and report anything that changes, then heads down through the suitroom to the garage to check on the bay after Raman's report of a light on inside.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":"garage"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"bauer","action":"Plants himself at the console and stares at the board, hands flat on the panel to keep them off the keys, narrating the readings to himself so he doesn't feel useless.","says":"Okay — okay, I'm watching it. I'm watching the board. Nothing's touching anything. Go, I've got it, I've got it.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Sorensen's voice comes over the channel from the suitroom: there's dust worked into the crack at Raman's visor seal and she's coughing, so he's walking her to the med bay now.","scope":"local","who":["sorensen","raman"],"where":"suitroom","visibility":"heard","moves":[{"id":"sorensen","to":"med"},{"id":"raman","to":"med"}]}
 ]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit asks the room what's wrong with Raman's scan","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"okafor","action":"Hold the tablet up so Kit can see the scan and state the finding plainly, then start issuing orders about water and the array.","says":"Dust in the alveolar spaces, both lower lobes, and her sats are drifting down. We have one working scanner and no way to lavage a lung on this rock. Lev, I want her on oxygen and I want a number every twenty minutes.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"sorensen","action":"Take the tablet back and gently explain the scan in plain terms while he sets up the oxygen line.","says":"It's pneumonitis from the dust, not an infection — the fine fraction is what gets you. It's treatable if she rests and we keep her oxygen up. It's just that resting is the one thing this station is bad at.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"raman","action":"Wave off the talk about her lungs and press for the array status, trying to sit up further than she should.","says":"It's dust, I've breathed dust before. Kit — the array. Tell me the panels are still there.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[{"text":"Teo Bauer calls over the intercom from Hydroponics to report the array output still falling and ask whether he should start shutting down non-essential draws.","scope":"local","who":["bauer"],"where":"hydro","visibility":"heard","moves":[]}]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit keys the intercom to Hydroponics and tells Teo to toggle non-essential draws off until the recycler shaft is back in its housing.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"okafor","action":"Okafor endorses the order and then presses Kit for a hard hour on when the shaft goes back in, because she needs a number she can put in the log.","says":"Log it as a controlled draw-down, not a failure. Kit — when the shaft is seated, I want the hour before you start it, not after.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"sorensen","action":"Sorensen keeps the oxygen line set and takes another saturation reading, then pulls the stool over beside Raman's cot and sits down heavily rather than leave the bay.","says":"Ninety-one. That's down two. I'm staying right here, Priya, so argue with me instead of the wall.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"raman","action":"Raman pushes the oxygen mask aside to talk and demands Kit tell her straight whether the panels are still on the racks or gone.","says":"Forget the draws. The racks — did the array hold, or did I lose them out there for nothing?","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[{"text":"Teo Bauer answers over the intercom that he is toggling the non-essential draws now, and his voice is a little too quick as he reads the list back.","scope":"local","who":["bauer"],"where":"hydro","visibility":"heard","moves":[]}]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit keys the intercom and asks Teo how the solar array's signal looks now that the storm has crossed the field.","needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"okafor","action":"Waits out the intercom exchange, then presses Kit again for a firm timeline on the shaft and the hour's notice before restart.","says":"Whatever the array reads, I need a number from you, Kit. When the shaft is seated, I get my hour.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"sorensen","action":"Keeps his seat by Raman's cot, watching the oximeter and quietly re-checking her mask seal rather than joining the argument.","says":"Ninety-one still. Hold the mask on, Priya, please.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"raman","action":"Pushes herself half up on the cot, ignoring Sorensen, to hear the array answer herself and demand Kit repeat it clearly.","says":"Say it plain, Kit. Did the racks hold or not?","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Teo Bauer answers over the intercom that the array's signal is down to a fraction of nominal and still falling, his voice going faster as he reads the figures.","scope":"local","who":["bauer"],"where":"hydro","visibility":"heard","moves":[]}
 ]}

{"player":{"summary":"Kit leaves the med bay and returns to the garage to set up the lathe and cut the impeller shaft back to true.","needs_roll":true,"skill":"tech","difficulty":"normal","move_to":"garage"},
 "intents":[
  {"id":"okafor","action":"Okafor walks to Ops to write the controlled draw-down entry in the station log and draft the power-status update for Mission Control, timed so the hour's notice stays hers to give.","says":"The moment the shaft is seated, you call me. Not the intercom, me.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":"ops"},
  {"id":"sorensen","action":"Sorensen stays at Raman's cot, checking her saturation and swapping the oxygen mask, running on fumes and talking softly to keep her flat and calm.","says":"Twenty more minutes, then I want you asleep, not negotiating.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null},
  {"id":"raman","action":"Raman lies back on the oxygen but keeps needling about the garage light and asks whether anyone ever answered who was in there while she was on the racks.","says":"Nobody's said a word about that bay light. Somebody was in the garage, and it wasn't me.","reveals":null,"visible":true,"needs_roll":false,"skill":null,"difficulty":"normal","move_to":null}
 ],
 "events":[
  {"text":"Teo Bauer calls the intercom from Hydroponics to say the recycler housing is still open with the shaft out, the reserve is dropping faster than his rationing model, and asks whether he should abandon the console and come help at the lathe.","scope":"local","who":["bauer"],"where":"hydro","visibility":"heard","moves":[]},
  {"text":"Alone at Raman's cot, Sorensen glances at his wrist display and sees the lab incubator's temperature telemetry drifting out of band, and says nothing about it.","scope":"local","who":["sorensen"],"where":"med","visibility":"hidden","moves":[]}
 ]}
